        "created_at": "2011-08-17T05:24:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It could also be possible to do some tournaments at local gaming stores.  If there is one in your area, try asking them if they’d be willing to host one.  Depending on when, you might even be able to talk Christopher into coming down to run it <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=9\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>",
