        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lynkfox/{size}/1997_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-10T18:27:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well it’s cooperative so there isn’t really a tourney format for SoTM.</p>\n<p>Tactics however can be competive so that is a tourney portion when it comes out. But GtG isn’t that big like Wizards or even Fantasy Flight so I’m not so certain ‘sanctioned’ tournaments with prize support will be a thing, at least not very often</p>",
